{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_title", "source_sha256": "297b3905c6ca1310f99beee85b7657ccea9a6da3d3f22080dc3365c5269b005c", "ja": "秋の風に誘われて", "zh": "在秋风相邀之下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a0c0f7755453c39c4d3f19eea6cf756081f1890ebb3852260589830486b6370", "ja": "ある秋の日。\n急な仕事の話に慌てながらも、\n期待に胸をふくらませる\nアイドルたちの一幕です。", "zh": "某一个秋天的日子。\n那是偶像们虽然因为\n临时的工作而慌张，\n但仍充满期待的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1000_007ior", "source_sha256": "309ab2289e4ef37e4154aa11ef17e5a236bd8f2ddc66805d404a219d2ff7c053", "ja": "ふう……もう夏も終わったって言うのに、\nまだまだ暑いわねー。", "zh": "呼……夏天明明都已经过了，\n却还是好热喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "229b1167174cbbd335e11b063a62eb5e4301094ad20056e056f53c113d9f9ef0", "ja": "やよい、私の衣装、どこもヨレたりしてないわよね？\n試着でダメにしちゃったりしたら、美咲に悪いわ。", "zh": "弥生，我的服装应该没有皱掉吧？\n要是试穿时弄皱，就太对不起美咲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1002_005yay", "source_sha256": "615f271065dad16ea01f4ec67c72bc4cd3b08a2978be43714db57e1e5ddc90f3", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、伊織ちゃん。\nもしもの時は、私が持って帰ってお手入れするね！", "zh": "放心吧，伊织。\n要是真的皱掉了，我就带回去帮你弄好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "0c0e21acebe4c6e6c5f0f66edf7a12c5e90dc4dfc8302688ed98e2c4f94770df", "ja": "今はまだ暑いけど、その分、洗濯物がぱぱーって乾いて\nとっても気持ちいいんだよ！", "zh": "虽然现在天气还很热，但洗好的衣服也干得很快，\n晾起来很舒服喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "8f66ed7f622451fe24caacffa8194414c868ac22c1d647403e086b8cbc58aca0", "ja": "そうなの？　洗濯はメイドに任せっきりだけど……\n私も自分で干したりしたら、そう思うのかしら。", "zh": "是吗？我们家衣服都交给女仆洗……\n如果我也自己晾衣服的话，也会觉得很舒服吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1005_005yay", "source_sha256": "e02b12141e5db883a1ab800956da6f53fb295965ec71d8d64c2c5698b24b76cc", "ja": "家事をする伊織ちゃんかぁ～。\nえへへっ、なんかカワイイかも！", "zh": "做家事的伊织啊～\n嘿嘿，感觉好像很可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "5e83587f06c88a570f027e0795c206105670ef4718f6247ef1aa2a9c4dba2c76", "ja": "ちょっと、ヘンなこと言わないでよ。\nそんな台詞、{$P$}に聞かれたら……", "zh": "我说你，别乱讲话啦。\n要是被{$P$}听见……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c6825136a91b4b752467947b0133c954bfd2973eebe545a1e1ce8cc64065eb55", "ja": "なるほど、家庭的な伊織か。\n意外な組み合わせで、面白そうだな！", "zh": "原来如此，贤慧顾家的伊织啊……\n这组合出人意料，感觉很有趣呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1008_005yay", "source_sha256": "a65d7b9284f82502c02aa1e7ec98e8a6965875cc5b8108124b6f7bfd294d321e", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れ様です～。", "zh": "{$P$}，工作辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "2a50296a33cf7920a7613164be7efd2a61b01206f617a88f6bf7207b91aa90c9", "ja": "……思った通りだったわ。アンタはスグ、そういう\nヘンなこと言い出すから、聞かれたくなかったの！", "zh": "……我就知道。你老是动不动出馊主意，\n所以我才不想让你听见的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "bdeda971804622e5008b2eaec4c33b20bf8b971506703c0d36a2295aeac3e00a", "ja": "また何かカン違いして、ヘンな仕事をとって来たら\n承知しないわよ？", "zh": "要是你又误会什么了，找来奇怪的工作，\n我可饶不了你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "17f72fc097756f03be0a2b8654637ec9d2dc1e38964b4ad974f396e2c5be77d3", "ja": "わかった、気をつけるよ……。\nでも今回の仕事は、大丈夫だと思う。", "zh": "我知道了，我会注意的……\n不过这次的工作应该没有问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "a02f6e2072180e75f80a38fdacf7400d2d0d62a1fd0c72ebd6b7a83be7fbfe8f", "ja": "あっ。新しいお仕事、決まったんですか？", "zh": "啊！新的工作已经决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ff94fa8264259ec3ccb6665d9c3a102a29570b5f273cac41f49884e322e9f350", "ja": "ああ、その衣装のPRもかねて、この季節ならではの\n和風で幻想的な、ふたりのPVを作ることになった！", "zh": "是啊，这次要为你们拍摄和风梦幻的PV，\n除了当季独有的镜头外，也顺便宣传这套服装！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1014_p", "source_sha256": "283ddbeec90b3b8a06fd9e2bc96d7d70974af280b94b1a3898fc9d9734d440cb", "ja": "……ほら、何もヘンじゃないだろ？", "zh": "……你看，一点都不奇怪吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "0211e07ee187ce0eff1e8421442df5b17e8c6c67c06eeb8eaeee880f54aa9c21", "ja": "わああ～、すごいかも！\nえへへっ、楽しみだね、伊織ちゃん！", "zh": "哇啊啊～好厉害喔！\n嘿嘿，好期待喔，伊织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "afb1d823bff4b0b89de2928f2676fd005177f697f81ce30b2676aee8180e3aaa", "ja": "そ……そうね。景色がいい季節だし、\n和風で幻想的、っていうのも気に入ったわ。", "zh": "对……对啊。现在这季节的风景优美，\n而且我也很喜欢和风梦幻的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "c88b3c88415ad8d449b0715f2ce710cecb1109b68327ee9b39bc4a377098aafe", "ja": "私の美貌を輝かせる、いいPVが撮れそうね。\n今回はホメてあげる♪", "zh": "拍出来的PV应该能衬托出我的美貌吧。\n这次你值得夸奖呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "b418cfa3315fa3537d40259796e2e351caf279b0b5cf860d7edf6ee3e1007b79", "ja": "ありがとう！　それじゃ早速で悪いけど、\n旅行の準備をしてくれ。", "zh": "谢谢！不过接下来要麻烦你们\n赶快做好旅行的准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1019_005yay", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ff125ccf73faf4111de3a50a9cbb7d301761e170c62fdb1313a71d04b3c7b295", "ja": "最高の景色と紅葉を求めて、日本各地に泊まりがけの\nロケに行く予定だ。出発は……明日、とか。", "zh": "为了寻求最棒的景色和枫叶，\n我们要到日本各地过夜取景。预计是……明天出发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1022_005yay", "source_sha256": "af7c624ed06df23ca452a289207bcf4373437639b77804ebd3bf9f773817374c", "ja": "明日っ！　わ、わかりました～。\n今日は早く帰って、急いで準備しなくちゃっ！", "zh": "明天！我、我知道了～\n今天要早点回去，赶紧准备才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1023_007ior", "source_sha256": "13295c002535cd7bb296c8ce0fed5f1de8866fb05481efb768409c84c6846436", "ja": "って、いくらなんでも急すぎるわよ！", "zh": "喂！这再怎么说都太赶了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "91f83db3b376f83a2fec5d582c7e343f5834fe4fc9a696b38f1f59fde71f3560", "ja": "そうなんだけど……最高の景色となると、場所も時間も\n限られてて、今行くしかないんだ。頼む！", "zh": "的确是很赶……但是为了拍摄最棒的景色，\n地点和时间都很有限，只能现在过去了。拜托你们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1025_007ior", "source_sha256": "9c764bd861fe5ff6fc1d3df5b8f3ee7dc3d91b3f9a54b3545abbad05c1880df7", "ja": "まったく、しょうがないわね～。\nやよい、その……大丈夫なの？", "zh": "真是的，真拿你没办法～\n弥生，那个……你没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1026_005yay", "source_sha256": "94c27be76060f2fabf0801c1f06e9f54afbb788b6211e25ff5ba02348b9089f7", "ja": "うん、家のことは、かすみに頼めるから。\n長介も、ちゃんとお手伝いしてくれるかなーって。", "zh": "嗯，家事可以拜托霞。\n长介他应该也会乖乖帮忙的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1027_005yay", "source_sha256": "44484468262bf4812d5fc8591df02b8587aaf3ee52e8d0858528567af21bf04c", "ja": "あっ、そろそろお味噌が切れそうだから……。\nあと野菜は、明後日の特売で買ってもらって……。", "zh": "啊！味噌快要没了……\n还有蔬菜，要请他们记得去后天的特卖……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1028_007ior", "source_sha256": "7a0f6b0bb7134992714729cc86625f05cb471e2e99a23926115870d91d08e01c", "ja": "やっぱり大変なんじゃない、もう……。\nちょっとアンタ、約束しなさい！", "zh": "果然还是很忙碌啊，真是的……\n我说你啊，你要向我们保证！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1029_007ior", "source_sha256": "780366e43dfa74dd2fdc53b04509363ee4d6480c6dedda98b22234c1820f146f", "ja": "私達にこんなムリをさせる以上、スタッフも最高の人材\nをそろえて、最高のPVに仕上げること。いいわね！", "zh": "既然把我们的行程排得这么紧，你最好找来\n最优秀的工作人员，拍摄出最棒的PV，知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a60daa5b4f9bda546eb0c9e96d5ff37ebbb0f08b1f91a773a851f6c5cb3b4c79", "ja": "もちろん、約束するよ。急な話で悪いけど、\nみんなで一緒にがんばって、最高のPVにしよう！", "zh": "那当然，我保证。很抱歉让你们这么赶，\n大家一起努力，拍出最棒的PV吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1031_005yay", "source_sha256": "f522fc62b1512067f5179bff6fe42b9bf127d6179a1012e57635f73395d95c21", "ja": "はーい！　一生懸命がんばりまーす！", "zh": "好──！我会全力以赴的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1032_007ior", "source_sha256": "5da374d844000de455afd3f655ae1a9e064fcbe66b420182b7555b46856d7b82", "ja": "そうね。私を撮る以上、どうしたって最高のPVになる\nハズだけど……、念のため頑張るわ♪", "zh": "好吧。虽然只要有我参加，不管怎么拍都会是\n最棒的PV……但以防万一，还是努力一下吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1033_005yay", "source_sha256": "030fa57ccf084674246f39e2c17e409e94ee6474841c2975ec87fcef783114bb", "ja": "一緒にお泊りなんてひさしぶりだね、伊織ちゃん！\nえへへっ、すっごく楽しみ！", "zh": "我们好久没有一起过夜了耶，伊织！\n嘿嘿，好期待喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1034_007ior", "source_sha256": "5e2a43f24cdbc881634d24149ecdda715148f50d9546d6005485edd0c49f6536", "ja": "そ、そうね……あ、お弁当は作って来なくていいわよ？\nせっかくなんだから、ご当地モノを食べてみましょう♪", "zh": "是、是啊……啊，你不用做便当带过去喔。\n难得有这机会，我们就去吃当地的美食吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_006_fc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_006_fc_01_1035_p", "source_sha256": "4cc730343fd8b00f1c45654da9b4fe249e165270d771fcb623fde3164e420f1f", "ja": "（急な話だったけど、ふたりの心は早くも旅の空に……\n本当に楽しそうな、いい笑顔が撮れそうだ！）", "zh": "（虽然事出突然，但两人的心早已踏上旅程了……\n看来应该能拍到发自内心的欢乐笑容！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
